zone:11:40:106:119:20:30:The treehouse nestled in the enchanted secret garden is a whimsical haven, blending seamlessly into the branches of a ancient, gnarled tree. Its wooden boards are weathered to a soft, silvery gray, and the roof is a lush carpet of living greenery, complete with tiny, star-shaped flowers.
